et scrape job, and keeps the still-true half of the old claim: no job_name, scrape_configs or remote_write exists anywhere in this repo (grep -rn 'job_name' / 'scrape_configs' / 'remote_write' over *.yaml, *.yml, *.toml, *.md returns nothing).\n3. No line of docs/observability-spec.md still attributes the fleet scrape job to OBS-OB-005 (grep -n 'OBS-OB-005' docs/observability-spec.md shows only its landed label/seed work).\n4. The change is documentation-only and leaves the suite green: go vet ./... exits 0 and go test ./internal/metrics ./internal/api exits 0.","type":"chore"}
